OL,3,GNEWSALockerbie bombing trial date set
OL,4,Aas judge warns against further delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA date has been set for the trial of a
OL,7,FLibyan man accused of making the bomb
OL,8,Fthat blew up a passenger plane over
OL,9,FLockerbie almost 40 years ago.
OL,11,FJudge Dabney Friedrich said the federal
OL,12,Fprosecution of Abu Agila Mas'ud Kheir
OL,13,FAl-Marimi over the deadliest terrorist
OL,14,Fattack in UK history would finally get
OL,15,Funder way on 19 January.
OL,17,FJury selection was due to start in
OL,18,FWashington DC in August but it was
OL,19,Fpostponed after new evidence on the
OL,20,Fcase came to light.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
